\subsubsection parameters ROS parameters

Reads and maintains the following parameters on the ROS server

- \b "~filter_update_rate" : \b [int] Tracking filter output data rate (fixed on initialization) min: 1, default: 20, max: 100
- \b "~filter_min_time" : \b [double] Minimum time before target begins being tracked min: 0.0, default: 0.5, max: 10.0
- \b "~filter_timeout" : \b [double] Timeout for filter updates, after which target is dropped min: 0.0, default: 0.5, max: 10.0
- \b "~filter_val_gate_thresh" : \b [double] Tracking filter validation gate threshold for new measurements min: 0.207, default: 1.064, max: 9.488
- \b "~kf_init_range_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter initial range standard deviation, in meters min: 0.001, default: 1.0, max: 10.0
- \b "~kf_init_speed_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter initial speed standard deviation, in meters per second min: 0.001, default: 2.0, max: 10.0
- \b "~kf_init_azim_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter initial azimuth standard deviation, in degrees min: 0.01, default: 1.0, max: 90.0
- \b "~kf_init_elev_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter initial elevation standard deviation, in degrees min: 0.01, default: 1.0, max: 90.0
- \b "~kf_q_speed_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter speed process noise standard deviation, in meters per second min: 0.001, default: 5.0, max: 10.0
- \b "~kf_q_azim_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter azimuth process noise standard deviation, in degrees min: 0.01, default: 10.0, max: 90.0
- \b "~kf_q_elev_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter elevation process noise standard deviation, in degrees min: 0.01, default: 10.0, max: 90.0
- \b "~kf_r_range_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter range measurement noise standard deviation, in meters per second min: 0.001, default: 1.0, max: 10.0
- \b "~kf_r_speed_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter speed measurement noise standard deviation, in meters per second min: 0.001, default: 5.0, max: 10.0
- \b "~kf_r_azim_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter azimuth measurement noise standard deviation, in degrees min: 0.01, default: 20.0, max: 90.0
- \b "~kf_r_elev_stdev" : \b [double] Kalman Filter elevation measurement noise standard deviation, in degrees min: 0.01, default: 20.0, max: 90.0

